    "sections": [
      {
        "label": "1st period",
        "score": "OTT 2, BOS 0",
        "text": "Boston's power play backfired. Michael Amadio intercepted a pass, and Tim Stutzle one-timed his feed past Jeremy Swayman short-handed at 7:39 for 1–0. At 9:22, three seconds after that power play expired, Stutzle stole another pass and scored again for 2–0."
      },
      {
        "label": "2nd period",
        "score": "OTT 4, BOS 0",
        "text": "Stutzle forced a turnover and sent Drake Batherson in alone for a backhand goal 1:06 in, 3–0, and Amadio one-timed a no-look feed from Shane Pinto at 5:19, 4–0. Linus Ullmark stopped all 10 shots he faced through two periods but was shaken up in a crease collision with JJ Peterka."
      },
      {
        "label": "3rd period",
        "score": "Final: OTT 4, BOS 1",
        "text": "Samuel Ersson took over in goal as a precaution, and James Hagens spoiled the shutout at 3:30 when his pass toward Matthew Poitras deflected in off Ersson, 4–1. Boston finished 0-for-4 on the power play."
      }
    ],
